{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超祝賀當選的選委會委員，形容今次選舉充分展現愛國者之間良性競爭，亦感謝投票人積極投票，優中選優，助力香港未來發展和改革，包括落實《香港第一個五年規劃》。<br/>\n<br/>\n港澳辦及中聯辦都說，今次選舉彰顯新選舉制度的優越性。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:10:18.034251+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:48:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:04:35.951922+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:03:52.082388+00:00","content_hash":"41b00798030ad3e5f7e87ba6a01d6a7afec131794a852b4ad6269873ded5c2a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}